<p:notes xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"/></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Slide Image Placeholder 1"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldImg" idx="0"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Notes Placeholder 2"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"/><a:lstStyle xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"/><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>对应正文：P004_Windows，11.4.3_用同一应用验证最小增量</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t># Windows UCRT64；源码根；11.2.1 的 SDK 已注册，源码入口按本命令选择，.venv 已激活。</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>cmake -S samples/hello_world -B build/learning-tools/p003/build-practice -G Ninja \</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>  -DBOARD=practice_mps2/an386 \</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>  "-DBOARD_ROOT=$(cygpath -m "$PWD/build/learning-tools/p003/new-board")" \</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>  "-DZephyr_DIR=$ZEPHYR_BASE/share/zephyr-package/cmake" \</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>  "-DZEPHYR_BASE=$ZEPHYR_BASE" \</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t/></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t/></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>  "-DZEPHYR_MODULES=$(cygpath -m "$PWD/build/learning-tools/deps/cmsis_6")" \</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>  -DEXTRA_ZEPHYR_MODULES= -DZEPHYR_EXTRA_MODULES= \</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>  "-DPython3_EXECUTABLE=$(cygpath -m "$(command -v python)")" \</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>  -DCMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS=ON</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>完整操作单元：../commands/P011_Windows/11.4.3-01.txt</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"><a:r><a:t>官方文件、教程自建文件与生成产物按本页说明区分。</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Slide Number Placeholder 3"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldNum" idx="5"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"/><a:lstStyle xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"/><a:p xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"/></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main"/></p:clrMapOvr></p:notes>